sequenceDiagram
  participant board as Board
  participant client as Client package
  participant api as API
  participant auth as Auth service
  participant database as PostgreSQL
  board->>api: Request protected resource with access token
  api->>auth: Validate access token
  auth-->>api: Access token expired
  api-->>board: 401: access token expired
  board->>client: Queue concurrent requests behind one refresh
  client->>api: POST /auth/refresh with refresh cookie
  api->>auth: Hash, validate, and rotate token family
  auth->>database: Revoke prior token and persist successor
  database-->>auth: Commit rotation
  auth-->>api: Return new access and refresh tokens
  api-->>client: Set rotated cookie and return access token
  client-->>board: Retry each queued request once
